OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum's future at castle
OL,4,Auncertain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council review has left the future of
OL,7,Fa regimental museum at Shrewsbury
OL,8,FCastle uncertain.
OL,10,FShropshire Council said it wanted to
OL,11,Fsee what repairs were needed and also
OL,12,Fput together a plan to make sure the
OL,13,Fcastle remained financially viable.
OL,15,FThe Soldiers of Shropshire Museum has
OL,16,Fbeen based at Shrewsbury Castle for
OL,17,Fmore than 40 years and tells the story
OL,18,Fof Shropshire regiments going back to
OL,19,Fthe 18th Century,
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
