OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum's future at castle
OL,4,Auncertain
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts lease is due to expire next May and
OL,7,Fthe council said it was talking to the
OL,8,Fmuseum trustees who were considering
OL,9,Fthe possibility of a move elsewhere.
